{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">近年行山發生意外的新聞屢見不鮮，特別是平時缺乏運動的「週末戰士」，在秋夏日行山時更易墮入中暑陷阱。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"fcf1e7ec-7caf-4867-8fd1-b8faee117e1f.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026II7UWoxgD91788922421.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"fcf1e7ec-7caf-4867-8fd1-b8faee117e1f.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">除熱中暑外，還包括以下兩種較輕微的運動型熱病：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">萬一身邊同行者不幸中暑，應立即採取以下急救法：</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">轉移陣地： 移至陰涼且空氣流通處。</p></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">香港教育大學的雷雄德博士建議做好以下準備：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">科學補水：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul></li></ul><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"eed6505e-d346-47df-bc9d-ae3db032a966.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026ICDKBACDU61788922421.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"eed6505e-d346-47df-bc9d-ae3db032a966.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">營養師施穎軒指出：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ad2a5f20-ac8e-4385-bb07-4f51a3cc7806.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026HfqTTlgZ1N1788922422.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ad2a5f20-ac8e-4385-bb07-4f51a3cc7806.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/><span style='font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\";'>**</span>本節目內主持及嘉賓的言論純屬個人意見並不代表本台立場。此內容僅供參考。如需獲得醫療意見或診斷，請諮詢專業人士。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-13T07:18:38.720531+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}